## 2. Layer-by-Layer Responsibilities

| Layer | Responsibility | Key Technologies |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **UI Layer** | Render stateless UI and capture user actions. Must never execute business logic directly. | Jetpack Compose, Material 3, `@Composable` |
| **ViewModel** | Manages UI state, transforms domain models into `StateFlow<UiState>`, handles coroutine scopes (`viewModelScope`). | Kotlin `StateFlow`, Hilt (`@HiltViewModel`) |
| **Domain Layer** | Encapsulates pure business logic into single-purpose UseCases. Independent of Android framework classes. | Pure Kotlin, `Result<T>` |
| **Data Layer** | Single source of truth. Handles network API requests, local database caching, and data mapping. | Retrofit, OkHttp, Room DB, EncryptedSharedPreferences |

