## Checklist for Android MVVM PR Approval

- [ ] Architecture follows **Clean Architecture (UI -> Domain -> Data)**.
- [ ] ViewModel uses `StateFlow` and immutable UI state (Sealed Interface).
- [ ] Jetpack Compose uses `collectAsStateWithLifecycle()`.
- [ ] UseCases are pure Kotlin with zero `android.*` imports.
- [ ] Repository acts as single source of truth handling network/cache fallback.
- [ ] Unit tests written for ViewModel state transitions and UseCases.
